    "workflow/agent-memory": {
      "description": "Improving the instructions as one of the agent's primary jobs: an always-loaded memory that has the agent constantly find stale, failed, missing, costly, repeated and unrecorded instructions and fix or propose the fix, the about-agent-memory skill (what a memory is, where it lives and how to write one), the /harvest command (scan the session for mistakes, lessons and waste, and propose changes to the instructions, made once the user approves), the /reflect command (why the agent took a recent action, with its sources quoted; changes nothing), and the /mistake command (trace a recent mistake to the instruction behind it, then fix that instruction once the user approves).",
